#: 871eb3d5280d4764aca80689de89a532
msgid "配置解析"
msgstr "Configuration Parsing"

#: 3d7560090da34edba7272c9f69ad96b2
msgid "从 YAML 文件读取配置，并与默认配置合并。"
msgstr ""
"Reads configuration from a YAML file and merges it with the default "
"configuration."

#: bb85565ff2f54b48803ca9a1ba1d17d5
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: a8f2d25a9a8e4864b2d0fe90993ec786
msgid "用户指定的配置文件路径。默认为 'config_default.yaml'。"
msgstr ""
"Path to the user-specified configuration file. Defaults to 'config_default."
"yaml'."

#: 2020af5508b9425a9086269ae354837a
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: da0ed004b19f45e9af3261b95d80f6db
msgid "一个 EasyDict 对象，包含了合并后的最终配置，可以通过属性点号 `.` 方便地访问各级配置项。"
msgstr ""
"An EasyDict object containing the final merged configuration, allowing "
"convenient access to configuration items via attribute dot notation `.`."

#: 581df0f4bfff4229bcf7b982136a4514
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"